{"product_id":"the-dark-history-of-the-reincarnated-villainess-vol-3-the-dark-history-of-the-reincarnated-villainess-3","title":"The Dark History of the Reincarnated Villainess, Vol. 3 (The Dark History of the Reincarnated Villainess, 3)","description":"\u003cp\u003eI won’t let you pretend you’ve forgotten my face! Konoha Satou spent her teen years writing selfindulgent fantasy romance fics-like her Dark History. Now, reborn as the most despicable villainess in her story, her life depends on remembering every last detail! When Satou hears whispers of beautiful women going missing in the Rose Kingdom, she doesn’t pay much attention to it-at first. After all, it’s not really an important part of the story…meaning there’s no way she could trip a death flag…right?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 191\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Akiharu Touka\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781975320522\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 160\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45434484261017,"sku":"Manga-A-39781975320522","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/683b22fbe8556-The-Dark-History-of-the-Reincarnated-Villainess-Vol-3-The-Dark-History-of-the-Rein_4553_1.jpg?v=1753121629","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-dark-history-of-the-reincarnated-villainess-vol-3-the-dark-history-of-the-reincarnated-villainess-3","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}